Ungate marker-start, marker-mid and marker-end in stylo's Servo build.

This targets the STYLO repository (https://github.com/servo/stylo), not
servo -- it sits outside the numbered servo series, like stylo-0001
through stylo-0004.

All three vertex-marker properties are behind #[cfg(feature = "gecko")],
so Servo cannot see any of them and no arrowhead ever renders. They are
plain UrlOrNone values with no Gecko-specific machinery behind them.

This is the FIFTH set of SVG properties found gated this way, after
pointer-events, stop-color/stop-opacity and
text-anchor/dominant-baseline. The pattern is now unmistakable: SVG
properties in stylo default to gecko-only regardless of whether anything
Gecko-specific is involved, and each one silently no-ops in Servo until
someone notices the missing rendering. Upstream, these five patches
should probably travel together as one "ungate the SVG properties
Servo's native SVG layout consumes" change.

Note: because the same file carries stylo-0002..0004's changes locally,
the line numbers in this hunk assume those are applied first. Apply the
stylo patches in order.

Consumed by servo patch 0024, which maps the three attributes as
presentational hints and places the markers.

To try it: check out stylo at the rev pinned in servo's Cargo.lock,
apply, and add a [patch."https://github.com/servo/stylo"] section
redirecting all eleven stylo-repo crates at the local checkout.

diff --git a/style/properties/longhands.toml b/style/properties/longhands.toml
index 27d96b253..90ce6836d 100644
--- a/style/properties/longhands.toml
+++ b/style/properties/longhands.toml
@@ -1284,29 +1284,26 @@ affects = "layout"
 
 [marker-end]
 type = "url::UrlOrNone"
 initial = "computed::url::UrlOrNone::none()"
 struct = "inherited_svg"
-engine = "gecko"
 animation_type = "discrete"
 spec = "https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/painting.html#VertexMarkerProperties"
 affects = "layout"
 
 [marker-mid]
 type = "url::UrlOrNone"
 initial = "computed::url::UrlOrNone::none()"
 struct = "inherited_svg"
-engine = "gecko"
 animation_type = "discrete"
 spec = "https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/painting.html#VertexMarkerProperties"
 affects = "layout"
 
 [marker-start]
 type = "url::UrlOrNone"
 initial = "computed::url::UrlOrNone::none()"
 struct = "inherited_svg"
-engine = "gecko"
 animation_type = "discrete"
 spec = "https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/painting.html#VertexMarkerProperties"
 affects = "layout"
 
 [masonry-auto-flow]
